DeepSeek Harness-derived TypeScript packages
============================================

The packages under packages/dsh-tui-* contain code extracted from the
DeepSeek Harness repository:

  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

The extracted source was reviewed from the local 0.1.0-rc.8 worktree and is
distributed under the MIT License with the original DeepSeek copyright notice.
The external package boundary in this repository does not redistribute the
Harness repository, its .git directory, or its unrelated packages.

The Rust presentation crates also contain Grok Build-derived Apache-2.0 code;
see NOTICE, LICENSE-APACHE, and the per-crate NOTICE files.
